WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.189
Dr. Dolittle and the animals walked back into King Jolliginki’s land.

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:09.577
They hoped to get back to the sea and find a way to return home.

3
00:00:09.578 --> 00:00:13.493
"We must be very quiet," Polynesia whispered.

4
00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:20.939
"If King Jolliginki hears us, he will send out the guards again."

5
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.643
Everyone was hungry and tired.

6
00:00:23.644 --> 00:00:31.222
Gub-Gub could not stop crying.

7
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:34.698
"I’ll find some food for you," said Chee-Chee.

8
00:00:34.699 --> 00:00:39.208
He jumped into a tree.

9
00:00:39.209 --> 00:00:42.375
"Some coconuts?" Gub-Gub sniffed.

10
00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:49.224
While Chee-Chee went off to look for food, Polynesia led the group.

11
00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:52.052
After a while, they got lost.

12
00:00:52.053 --> 00:00:55.798
"I’m sure it’s this way," Polynesia said.

13
00:00:55.799 --> 00:00:59.690
"We just came from there," complained Dab-Dab.

14
00:00:59.691 --> 00:01:02.368
"Oh, where is Chee-Chee?

15
00:01:02.369 --> 00:01:06.862
I’m so hungry," cried Gub-Gub.

16
00:01:06.863 --> 00:01:12.373
"Be QUIET!" everyone yelled at the pig.

17
00:01:12.374 --> 00:01:15.457
Everyone felt like giving up.

18
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:20.461
"Wait! Look over there!" Gub-Gub pointed excitedly.

19
00:01:20.462 --> 00:01:23.124
In front of them were fruit trees.

20
00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.415
Polynesia shook her head.

21
00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:27.576
"I don’t think it’s that way."

22
00:01:27.577 --> 00:01:32.181
"But we’re so hungry!" cried the animals.

23
00:01:32.182 --> 00:01:34.829
So they ran toward the trees.

24
00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:40.955
"At last! Food!" shouted Gub-Gub.

25
00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:44.064
Unfortunately, they had made a big mistake.

26
00:01:44.065 --> 00:01:48.046
They had walked right into King Jolliginki’s garden!

27
00:01:48.047 --> 00:01:52.013
"This time you will not escape!" one guard said.

28
00:01:52.014 --> 00:01:55.827
Dr. Dolittle and the animals were taken away.

29
00:01:55.828 --> 00:02:00.818
But Polynesia escaped once again.

30
00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:04.096
Meanwhile, Chee-Chee was very upset.

31
00:02:04.097 --> 00:02:07.429
"Where are they?" he wondered.

32
00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:08.956
He looked and looked.

33
00:02:08.957 --> 00:02:10.605
But it was no use.

34
00:02:10.606 --> 00:02:15.747
He could not find his friends.

35
00:02:15.748 --> 00:02:19.879
Dr. Dolittle stood before King Jolliginki again.

36
00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:24.861
"Please, I must get back to Puddleby," the doctor explained.

37
00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:30.327
The king laughed unkindly.

38
00:02:30.328 --> 00:02:32.680
"You are going nowhere!"

39
00:02:32.681 --> 00:02:35.380
"Please, you must let me . . ."

40
00:02:35.381 --> 00:02:39.712
Dr. Dolittle tried to speak but the king got angry.

41
00:02:39.713 --> 00:02:45.293
"Take him to the dungeon!" he roared.

42
00:02:45.294 --> 00:02:48.352
Finally, Chee-Chee found Polynesia.

43
00:02:48.353 --> 00:02:50.817
She explained what had happened.

44
00:02:50.818 --> 00:02:52.955
"The jungle is your home!

45
00:02:52.956 --> 00:02:56.344
How can you get lost?" he scolded.

46
00:02:56.345 --> 00:02:59.466
"Ssh!" Polynesia whispered.

47
00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:04.084
Below them a young man walked by.

48
00:03:04.085 --> 00:03:06.734
He sat down under a tree.

49
00:03:06.735 --> 00:03:10.601
"Who cares if I am a prince?" the man said.

50
00:03:10.602 --> 00:03:15.180
"That must be King Jolliginki’s son!" Chee-Chee whispered.

51
00:03:15.181 --> 00:03:17.126
The prince took his hat off.

52
00:03:17.127 --> 00:03:24.094
Sighing, he said, "I would do anything to have hair!"

53
00:03:24.095 --> 00:03:27.602
Polynesia began to blink very fast.

54
00:03:27.603 --> 00:03:29.979
This meant she was thinking.

55
00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:34.239
"Chee-Chee! I have a plan!" Polynesia said.

56
00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.237
She told him her idea.

57
00:03:36.238 --> 00:03:40.035
"You’re crazy! It’s too dangerous!"

58
00:03:40.036 --> 00:03:42.321
Chee-Chee refused to help.

59
00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:48.002
But in the end, the monkey agreed to help.

60
00:03:48.003 --> 00:03:51.666
Chee-Chee and Polynesia hid behind the leaves.

61
00:03:51.667 --> 00:03:57.112
"Prince of Jolliginki," Polynesia used a woman’s voice.

62
00:03:57.113 --> 00:04:00.324
"Who’s there?" the prince mumbled.

63
00:04:00.325 --> 00:04:04.860
"I am your fairy godmother," Polynesia said.

64
00:04:04.861 --> 00:04:09.040
"My fairy godmother?" the prince repeated.

65
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:15.654
"I’ll give you one wish," Polynesia said.

66
00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:18.412
The prince could not believe it.

67
00:04:18.413 --> 00:04:21.530
"Anything I want?" he asked again.

68
00:04:21.531 --> 00:04:24.151
"Yes," she answered.

69
00:04:24.152 --> 00:04:26.257
"I wish I had hair!"

70
00:04:26.258 --> 00:04:28.656
The prince closed his eyes.

71
00:04:28.657 --> 00:04:33.094
Polynesia’s plan was working!

72
00:04:33.095 --> 00:04:40.102
"Find Dr. Dolittle. He has a magic bottle," Polynesia told the smiling prince.

73
00:04:40.103 --> 00:04:42.816
"Where is he?" the prince asked.

74
00:04:42.817 --> 00:04:45.122
"In your father’s dungeon.

75
00:04:45.123 --> 00:04:48.412
You must go tonight, after dark."

76
00:04:48.413 --> 00:04:56.398
With that, the fairy godmother disappeared.

